; GaiaLabs Retranslation, chapter 22. Dialogue only.

?INCLUDE 'av69_lance'
av69_lance.dialogstring_06BAFA! `[CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: We finally made it.[FIN][CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]That tunnel took us nearly[N]two weeks to cross.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Lance: Huh? There's a sign[N]over there.[END]`
av69_lance.dialogstring_06BB50! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Lance: "Fallen Wing Clan.[N]Travelers may use this[N]room."[FIN][CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: So that's what[N]the people here call[N]themselves.[FIN][CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Maybe they left the room[N]for travelers because they[N]prefer not to meet them.[FIN][CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Either way, let's rest[N]before exploring.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'av69_lily'
av69_lily.dialogstring_06C224! `[CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: Will, after we get[N]settled, want to look[N]around with me?[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Will]Will: Sure. After being[N]stuck in that tunnel, some[N]fresh air sounds nice.[FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: Good. I was hoping[N]you'd say yes. Let's go.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'av69_kara'
av69_kara.dialogstring_06C3B1! `[CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: I like fresh air.[FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: I sorta wanted to[N]ask Will about something.[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: Well what if I[N]wanted to ask Will[N]something?[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Will]Will: Gosh, Lance also[N]said he wanted to ask me[N]something when we could[N]finally get space to talk.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Will]Maybe I should start[N]charging for advice.[FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: Don't flatter[N]yourself. You just keep[N]secrets better than...[N][PAU:F]certain other people.[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: You think I don't[N]keep secrets?[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Will]Will: Oh come on, Kara,[N]she didn't mean you.[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: You're flirting...[N]and at my expense![FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: I'm going[N]sightseeing alone! Don't[N]come with me...!![END]`

?INCLUDE 'av69_lily'
av69_lily.dialogstring_06C23C! `[CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: I think I know[N]what THAT was about...[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Lance: She's in a mood,[N]ain't she? Best leave her[N]alone.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'av69_signs'
av69_signs.dialogstring_06BA36! `[CLD][DEF][CLD][DLG:3,F][SIZ:D,5]Travelers:[N]Please use this room[N]Fallen Wing Clan[END]`
av69_signs.dialogstring_06BA6B! `[CLD][DEF][CLD][DLG:3,F][SIZ:D,5]Entrance to Fallen[N]Wing Village[END]`

?INCLUDE 'av6A_lance'
av6A_lance.dialogstring_06BC5C! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Lance: Will[AD] I got somethin'[N]I wanna talk about.[FIN]It's hard to say, but I[N]think I've fallen for[N]Lilly[AD][FIN]I even dream about her.[N]Before I knew it, I[N]couldn't stop watchin'[N]her.[FIN]Doesn't sound like me,[N]does it?[N][PAL:0] Yeah[AD][N] Not really`
av6A_lance.dialogstring_06BD1A! `[CLR][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Will]Will: Yeah. I never[N]thought I'd hear you say[N]something like that.[FIN]`
av6A_lance.dialogstring_06BD4A! `[CLR][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Will]Will: You two have spent a[N]lot of time together.[FIN]Falling for her wouldn't[N]be that strange.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Lance: Speakin' of that,[N]Lilly's fifteenth birthday[N]is comin' up.[FIN]I wanna tell her how I[N]feel with a present.[N]What should I give her?[FIN][PAL:0] A pretty bouquet[N] A wonderful necklace[N] A tender kiss[PAL:4]`
av6A_lance.dialogstring_06BE1F! `[CLR][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Will]Will: What girl wouldn't[N]like a bouquet of flowers?[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Lance: Yeah, that makes[N]sense.[FIN]Maybe I can confess with[N]tha language o' flowers.[N]Rosebuds, maybe.[FIN][JMP:&dialogstring_06BF7C]`
av6A_lance.dialogstring_06BE85! `[CLR][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Will]Will: How about something[N]she can wear often?[FIN]Then whenever she sees it,[N]she'll think of you.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Lance: Ah, I get it.[FIN]Then I'll find some pretty[N]stones and make her a[N]necklace.[FIN][JMP:&dialogstring_06BF7C]`
av6A_lance.dialogstring_06BF0A! `[CLR][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Will]Will: If you really like[N]her, why not just kiss[N]her?[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Lance: Outta nowhere!?[N]That seems pretty bold…[FIN]But if ya say so, maybe I[N]should try it…?[FIN][JMP:&dialogstring_06BF7C]`
av6A_lance.dialogstring_06BF7C! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Lance: Thanks fer lending[N]me yer advice.[FIN]I'll try to think of it[N]in my own way. Good[N]friends are nice to have,[N]ain't they.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'av6A_lily'
av6A_lily.dialogstring_06C2BD! `[CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: So this is where[N]the Fallen Wings live.[FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]I would've thought it was[N]gloomy before, but after[N]that tunnel, even this dim[N]light is wonderful.[FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Let's take that[N]walk after Kara cools off.[N]I don't want her getting[N]the wrong idea.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Will]Will: Wrong idea?[FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: Between you and[N]Lance, I'm starting to[N]think boys are oblivious.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Thought](Or maybe we just know[N]when to play dumb.)[END]`

?INCLUDE 'av6A_erik'
av6A_erik.dialogstring_06C52F! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Erik: The sunlight is[N]so bright, it hurts my[N]eyes if I open them too[N]wide.[WAI][N]Even though it's always[N]been there, I never[N]noticed before.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'av6A_neil'
av6A_neil.dialogstring_06C0D2! `[CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: I've been wondering[AD][N]Could the Fallen Wings be[N]descendants of the people[N]who escaped Mu?[END]`

?INCLUDE 'av6B_villagers1'
av6B_villagers1.dialogstring_06C799! `[CLD][BOR:B][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1D]This is Fallen Wing[N]Village.[WAI][N]Our bodies are weak.[N]Too much sunlight would[N]kill us.[END]`
av6B_villagers1.dialogstring_06C7EF! `[CLD][BOR:B][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1D]The sun looks gentle from[N]here. We can't stay out[N]in it for long.[END]`
av6B_villagers1.dialogstring_06C845! `[CLD][BOR:B][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1D]Travelers talk about the[N]open sky. I've spent my[N]whole life under stone.[END]`
av6B_villagers1.dialogstring_06C9BF! `[CLD][BOR:B][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1D]Down here, we can go about[N]our day without watching[N]where the sunlight falls.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'av6B_villagers3'
av6B_villagers3.dialogstring_06CBEE! `[BOR:B][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1D]There are stories that say[N]we evolved from humans.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'av6B_villagers2'
av6B_villagers2.dialogstring_06CB5E! `[CLD][BOR:B][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1D]A human girl came through[N]here not long ago.[WAI][N]Her name was Kara, or[N]something like that.[WAI][N]Ishtar praised her beauty,[N]and she followed him to[N]his studio.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'av6B_villagers3'
av6B_villagers3.dialogstring_06CC22! `[CLD][BOR:B][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1D]I'll tell you how to reach[N]the studio. Remember this.[WAI][N]First, follow the wind.[WAI][N]Watch which way the torch[N]flames bend.[WAI][N]Where the wind is[N]strongest in the dark[N]passage, you'll hear a[N]waterfall.[WAI][N]Search where the sound is[N]loudest.[WAI][N]Ishtar's studio lies[N]beyond there. Be careful.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'av6C_villagers4'
av6C_villagers4.dialogstring_06CA5C! `[BOR:B][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1D]This is something called[N]"danceˮ; a way that humans[N]amuse themselves.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'av6C_villagers5'
av6C_villagers5.dialogstring_06CD9A! `[CLD][BOR:B][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1D]We imitate human dancing[N]because we want to feel[N]what humans feel.[FIN]We practice every day.[N]Still, nothing changes.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'av6C_villagers4'
av6C_villagers4.dialogstring_06CA71! `[CLD][BOR:B][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1D]The picture on that wall[N]was painted by an artist[N]named Ishtar.[WAI][N]But somehow, his models[N]often disappear[N]afterward[AD][END]`

?INCLUDE 'av6C_villagers5'
av6C_villagers5.dialogstring_06CDD4! `[CLD][BOR:B][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1D]We have little emotion,[N]yet Ishtar paints our[N]faces as if they overflow[N]with human warmth.[WAI][N]Perhaps that is why[N]so many people ask him[N]to paint them,[WAI][N]even[N]though his models often[N]disappear.[END]`
av6C_villagers5.dialogstring_06CE56! `[BOR:B][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1D]My former dance partner[N]seems to have vanished[AD][WAI][N]So now I practice alone.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'av6B_ocean_ache'
av6B_ocean_ache.dialogstring_06C714! `[CLD][BOR:B][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1D]No one remembers when our[N]people first began living[N]here.[WAI][N]Yet when we look at the[N]ocean, something in our[N]chests still aches.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'av6B_villagers2'
av6B_villagers2.dialogstring_06CB07! `[CLD][BOR:B][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1D]We have almost no emotion.[N]We neither laugh nor cry.[FIN]Our bodies scarcely[N]change, and neither do[N]our hearts.[FIN]Our ancestors wished to[N]be freed from pain.[WAI][N]Perhaps pain and joy were[N]more closely joined than[N]they understood.[FIN]An unchanging life can be[N]peaceful.[WAI][N]It can also feel empty.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'av6B_musician'
av6B_musician.dialogstring_06D0C6! `[CLD][BOR:B][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1D]Woman playing the harp:[N]Music is medicine for the[N]spirit.[WAI][N]A beautiful song can ease[N]pain that no ordinary[N]medicine can reach.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'av6B_villagers1'
av6B_villagers1.dialogstring_06C981! `[BOR:B][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1D]I'm a sculptor. Before I[N]die, I intend to make a[N]thousand of these statues…[END]`

?INCLUDE 'av6C_only_sleeping'
av6C_only_sleeping.dialogstring_06D063! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Thought](They don't react at all[AD][N]It's as if their souls[N]were taken away.)[END]`

?INCLUDE 'av6B_villagers1'
av6B_villagers1.dialogstring_06C8B0! `[BOR:B][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1D]Do you know the painter,[N]Ishtar?[N][PAL:0] Yes[N] No[PAL:4]`
av6B_villagers1.dialogstring_06C8DC! `[CLR]Ask the villagers about[N]Ishtar. Someone may have[N]seen the girl you're[N]looking for.[END]`
av6B_villagers1.dialogstring_06C8F7! `[CLR]Ishtar's studio is beyond[N]this door.[FIN][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3]But creatures filled with[N]nothing but hatred roam[N]the passage ahead.[FIN][CLD][BOR:B][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1D]If you still intend to go,[N]you may open the door.[END]`
